+# Additional entries and exclusions within the acquired partial transcripts
+
+This additive note preserves two further page-level differences without changing the main report or source files. It is part of the same six-source comparison. See [ADDITIONAL-ENTRY-CHECK.json](ADDITIONAL-ENTRY-CHECK.json) for exact source text and line locators.
+
+## C06 — Direct Falmouth appears in the Radar transcript but not the selected Associate page
+
+S04 p2 records the direct-Falmouth instruction at **1250:47**, and p3 records the readback at **1250:51**. The earlier F04 p39 records **1250:48** and **1250:51**. S05 p4 passes through minute headings1250–1255 without either of those displayed utterance entries. This is a documented difference in partial-transcript content/selection and one printed instruction time. It does **not** establish that the original RA audio lacks the exchange, that the source R/RA channels contain identical material, or that any recording was cut. Different source channels, audibility, scope/selection and transcription/revision choices remain untested possibilities. Obtain the corresponding R/RA source channels, transcript instructions, copy/channel map and revision logs; do not equate omitted printed text with deleted sound.
+
+## C07 — The later Associate transcript prints additional short exchanges
+
+S05 p9 lists **1310:00 HNNRA: (unintelligible) what trade center**, followed by **1310:01 UNKN: world trade center (unintelligible)**. The earlier displayed F04 p45 does not list those two timestamped entries between its existing exchanges. This comparison is bounded to these actual pages, not a census of every agency record or a claim that the speech was newly invented or removed elsewhere.
+
+These intervening printed exchanges are context for the unconfirmed-to-confirmed relay inquiry. Their content does not identify an independent confirmation source, authenticate the speakers, or establish what caused the relay's wording. Conversely, an interpretation based only on the earlier displayed page must acknowledge the additional entries in this released version. The raw recordings and full connected-channel context remain missing. Neither version is chosen as controlling.
+
+All23 new page images were inspected; F04p39 was additionally revisited for this note, making seven previously held F04 page images revisited in this unit. These checks remain separate from original-audio authentication and the outstanding FAA2003/2006 correction/disposition requirements.
