+# Original-record dependencies carried forward
+
+- **B129 / PD01:** actual corrected May2003 QFR, approved/native drafts, transmittal, attachments and recipient/successor acknowledgment. The2002 dispatch here is not that event.
+- **PD02:** signed consideration/action/no-action decision, reasons, dates, approving authority and notice.
+- **PD03:** OIG response tracker, management response/nonconcurrence, actual implementation evidence and resolution/closure history crosswalking CC-2006-085 and042R0122001. Investigative closure is not implementation.
+- **PD04–PD07:** applicable investigation follow-up policy/version, routing/custodian/retention and original correction/release instructions. The AAT200 note's year/context is unverified and cannot stand for the2003 legal instruction.
+- **Version/custody test:** native/certified R/RA source audio, master/reel/channel IDs and copy logs, timecode-reader checks/calibration, transcript drafts/change notes and controlled version/enclosure lists. Identify which transcript versions were sent and received inMay2002 and used in later agency/Commission products.
+- **Dispatch test:** full source request, sender/receiver correspondence and itemized enclosure list, actual sender payloads, carrier delivery acknowledgment and recipient intake. The sender airbill and three-transcript/19statement account alone do not close receipt or content.
+- **Word/qualification test:** actual source-channel and connected-channel audio for the unconfirmed/confirmed relay, different time labels, ring/beep/unintelligible classifications, and selected call associations. No listening or source-clock/continuity test performed here.
+- **Telephone AUD016-A1 / TC05/B105,TC06/B110:** carrier/operator/PBX originals, Keyton interview, zero-duration exhibit andSeptember20usage report; call/leg/schema/clock/device joins. Do not substitute unrelated bank/phone records.
+- **Recorder TC01–TC04:** native/raw flight data and definitions, custody/continuity, independent decoding and radar/clock joins. The source-copy documentation here is not the technical owner's completed test.
+- **Materials AUD011-A2 / TC07–TC08:** original spectra/counts/calibration/geometry, collection/chip/region/run crosswalk and authenticated same-specimen heating/phase comparisons.
+- **Steel AUD011/AUD016;B188/H005:** actual preservation decisions, yard/intake/coupon transfers, aliases, attribution worksheets and rationale linking field-attributed candidates to NIST classifications.
+
+New catalog-only next locator: [ZID106 corrections, NAID7596427](https://catalog.archives.gov/id/7596427), listed in the [official finding aid](https://www.archives.gov/research/foia/faa-finding-aid-36-47). It is not acquired/read in this six-source unit; neither its title nor the neighboring dispatch proves its contents or underlying reason.
+
+No new request, outreach, fee or legal-spine edit is authorized by this queue. Missing/failed access does not establish withholding, destruction or motive.
